{{!
    @template vrroomruntime_builtin/liveparticipant

    One person in the live room list: name, teacher badge, where they are, their microphone and camera
    state, a speaking indicator and, for the others, "Mute for me" and (while their camera is on)
    "Hide video for me".

    Classes required for JS:
    * vrroom-live-speaking - the speaking indicator, switched with vrroom-live-speaking-on

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-peerid - the presence the line is for
    * data-action vrroom-live-mutepeer - mute or unmute that person for me
    * data-action vrroom-live-hidevideo - hide or show that person's video for me

    Context variables required for this template:
    * peerid - peer id (hex)
    * name - display name, plain text ("Sam Student (you)" for oneself)
    * isself - the line is the user's own
    * kindpreview - the person is a teacher in preview
    * where - where the person is, plain text
    * micstate - microphone state, plain text (may be empty)
    * camstate - camera state, plain text (empty while the camera is off)
    * mutedforme - the person is muted for this user
    * mutelabel - label of the mute button, plain text
    * video - show the "Hide video for me" button
    * videohiddenforme - the person's video is hidden for this user
    * videolabel - label of the hide video button, plain text

    Example context (json):
    {
        "peerid": "0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef",
        "name": "Alex Learner",
        "isself": false,
        "kindpreview": true,
        "where": "In VR",
        "micstate": "Microphone on",
        "camstate": "Camera on",
        "mutedforme": false,
        "mutelabel": "Mute Alex Learner for me",
        "video": true,
        "videohiddenforme": false,
        "videolabel": "Hide video of Alex Learner for me"
    }
}}
<div class="vrroom-live-participant d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2 py-1" data-peerid="{{peerid}}">
    <span class="vrroom-live-speaking" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="fw-bold">{{name}}</span>
    {{#kindpreview}}<span class="badge bg-secondary text-dark">{{#str}}livekindpreview, vrroomruntime_builtin{{/str}}</span>{{/kindpreview}}
    <span class="small text-muted">{{where}}</span>
    {{#micstate}}<span class="small">{{micstate}}</span>{{/micstate}}
    {{#camstate}}<span class="small vrroom-live-camstate">{{camstate}}</span>{{/camstate}}
    {{^isself}}
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-link btn-sm p-0" data-action="vrroom-live-mutepeer" aria-pressed="{{#mutedforme}}true{{/mutedforme}}{{^mutedforme}}false{{/mutedforme}}">{{mutelabel}}</button>
    {{#video}}
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-link btn-sm p-0" data-action="vrroom-live-hidevideo" aria-pressed="{{#videohiddenforme}}true{{/videohiddenforme}}{{^videohiddenforme}}false{{/videohiddenforme}}">{{videolabel}}</button>
    {{/video}}
    {{/isself}}
</div>
